// The AdMob app id of Info.plist (GADApplicationIdentifier). Google's sample app id by default;
// scripts/native/native-ids.cjs (run by npm run app:sync) writes the git-ignored ids.local.xcconfig
// next to this file with the id of the build, which wins. Never put a real id here.
// The same file sets MARKETING_VERSION (CFBundleShortVersionString), from package.json through
// scripts/native/app-version.cjs; the GitHub build also passes it to xcodebuild.
ADMOB_APP_ID = ca-app-pub-3940256099942544~1458002511
#include? "ids.local.xcconfig"
